FLYING THUNDER GOD TECHNIQUE — SEALING NOTES
Konohagakure Sealing Archive — Restricted

Technique: Flying Thunder God Technique (Hiraishin)
Nature: Space-time ninjutsu (S-rank)
Originator: Tobirama Senju, Second Hokage. Perfected by Minato Namikaze,
the Fourth Hokage, who earned the epithet "The Yellow Flash."

Principle: The user marks a location, object, or person with a special
formula seal. Upon activation, the user teleports instantly to any marked
seal. Minato's mastery allowed near-instantaneous battlefield movement,
making him effectively untouchable — his speed alone was entered in enemy
bingo books with flee-on-sight orders during the Third Shinobi War.

Notes: The technique requires exceptional fuinjutsu skill to formulate
the marking seal; it cannot be learned casually. Marking kunai were
distributed to allied forces to extend the Fourth's reach. Surviving
formula notes are retained under the Hokage's seal.
